WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.109 --> 00:00:13.818
A woman walked out of a fancy building.

2
00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.862
She reached into her bag for a small mirror.

3
00:00:17.882 --> 00:00:21.825
"Wonderful!" she said.

4
00:00:21.845 --> 00:00:25.588
"That spa treatment is like magic.

5
00:00:26.209 --> 00:00:29.432
I look—" Suddenly she started to shake.

6
00:00:32.128 --> 00:00:33.749
She grew smaller and smaller.

7
00:00:34.229 --> 00:00:37.511
And then "Goo-goo!

8
00:00:38.011 --> 00:00:44.035
Ga-ga!" "I love when Miss Apricot lets us have free time," Jack said.

9
00:00:45.656 --> 00:00:46.856
He was drawing a spaceship.

10
00:00:49.598 --> 00:00:50.738
Mara looked up from her book.

11
00:00:50.758 --> 00:00:53.900
"I'm just glad the school day is almost over.

12
00:00:54.981 --> 00:00:56.662
Did I tell you my big news?"

13
00:00:57.982 --> 00:00:59.123
Terrell raised an eyebrow.

14
00:00:59.143 --> 00:01:00.344
"What news?"

15
00:01:01.632 --> 00:01:02.193
"Tell us!"

16
00:01:02.613 --> 00:01:03.233
Roxy said.

17
00:01:03.253 --> 00:01:06.776
"I have a job," Mara said.

18
00:01:06.796 --> 00:01:09.017
"I start today after school!"

19
00:01:09.037 --> 00:01:11.719
"Whoa!" Jack said loudly.

20
00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:14.301
Miss Apricot looked up from her desk.

21
00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:19.905
"Shh!" "Sorry," Jack said.

22
00:01:20.785 --> 00:01:23.627
Then he looked back at Mara and whispered, "Whoa."

23
00:01:24.608 --> 00:01:25.528
"What's the job?"

24
00:01:25.849 --> 00:01:26.589
Terrell asked.

25
00:01:27.130 --> 00:01:28.631
"Will you be working in a store?"

26
00:01:29.811 --> 00:01:30.492
Jack grinned.

27
00:01:30.904 --> 00:01:33.986
"Will you be running a huge company, making millions of dollars?"

28
00:01:34.006 --> 00:01:36.608
"Are you going to be president?"

29
00:01:36.928 --> 00:01:37.629
Terrell asked.

30
00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:40.491
Jack and Terrell laughed.

31
00:01:43.433 --> 00:01:44.654
Mara rolled her eyes.

32
00:01:44.674 --> 00:01:47.896
"I'm going to be a mother's helper."

33
00:01:47.916 --> 00:01:51.358
"Cool!" Roxy said.

34
00:01:51.378 --> 00:01:53.440
"That's like babysitting, right?"

35
00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:55.561
Mara nodded.

36
00:01:55.581 --> 00:01:58.623
"Yep! I'll be helping my neighbor Mrs.

37
00:01:58.683 --> 00:02:03.031
Garson. She needs me to watch her two-year-old while she plans a party.

38
00:02:03.571 --> 00:02:05.272
Mrs. Garson will be there though.

39
00:02:05.553 --> 00:02:07.955
So it's not exactly like babysitting."

40
00:02:07.975 --> 00:02:11.117
"I'd like to get a job," Jack said.

41
00:02:11.137 --> 00:02:13.659
"But I don't want to watch little kids.

42
00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:17.102
I'd rather run a huge company and make millions of dollars!"

43
00:02:18.483 --> 00:02:21.085
"Watching little kids is hard," Terrell said.

44
00:02:21.105 --> 00:02:23.807
"I bet Rocket Girl is great at it!"

45
00:02:25.569 --> 00:02:26.870
Mara rolled her eyes again.

46
00:02:27.871 --> 00:02:29.092
Roxy rolled her eyes too.

47
00:02:30.976 --> 00:02:34.637
"Rocket Girl has more important things to do than babysit, Terrell."

48
00:02:36.297 --> 00:02:37.538
Suddenly her watch beeped.

49
00:02:41.479 --> 00:02:44.060
Roxy asked Miss Apricot if she could go to the restroom.

50
00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:46.560
Then she stepped into the hallway.

51
00:02:51.161 --> 00:02:52.282
Bloom," she said.

52
00:02:52.302 --> 00:02:54.402
"What's Oh, wow!

53
00:02:55.503 --> 00:02:56.703
You look so young!"

54
00:02:57.783 --> 00:02:58.823
Mayor Bloom blushed.

55
00:02:58.843 --> 00:03:00.404
"Oh, thank you.

56
00:03:01.064 --> 00:03:03.585
I went to a spa this morning and got a special treatment.

57
00:03:04.445 --> 00:03:05.425
I feel wonderful!"

58
00:03:05.445 --> 00:03:07.706
"So what's the problem?"

59
00:03:08.046 --> 00:03:08.786
Roxy asked.

60
00:03:10.006 --> 00:03:11.967
Mayor Bloom looked confused for a moment.

61
00:03:11.987 --> 00:03:13.387
"Oh, right!

62
00:03:13.927 --> 00:03:15.908
Yes, we have a very odd problem, Rocket Girl.

63
00:03:16.668 --> 00:03:18.989
The owner of Metro City Plumbing Supply, Mr.

64
00:03:19.009 --> 00:03:20.429
Copper, has disappeared.

65
00:03:21.289 --> 00:03:22.110
And that's not all.

66
00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:24.370
There's a baby in his office."

67
00:03:25.751 --> 00:03:26.871
Roxy scratched her head.

68
00:03:26.891 --> 00:03:28.751
"That is odd.

69
00:03:29.692 --> 00:03:30.752
But don't worry, Mayor.

70
00:03:31.144 --> 00:03:32.187
I'll check it out."
